      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hawthorn%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Pennsylvania Route 28 cuts through Hawthorn, heading southwest to New Bethlehem and northeast to Summerville.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
